skilletor: source "other" in the project config (${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.json) gives its only "git", "url" or "local", and the entry in the user config (${HOME}/.claude/skilletor.json) has none: config load would refuse that entry once this one is gone. Remove that entry first (skilletor source remove other), or give it a "git", "url" or "local" of its own; nothing was changed.
